12
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:34,610
Sniper’s focus tightens through rifle scope.

13
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:37,960
Mechanical flyer hovers over rooftops.

14
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:41,270
Sniper aims rifle at motionless older man.

15
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:46,030
Massive steampunk flyer hovers, smoke billowing from engines.

16
00:01:50,450 --> 00:01:54,230
Sniper holds rifle steady, eyes focused through scope in dim room.

17
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:03,270
Old man clutches chest, gasps; sniper holds rifle steady, focused.

18
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:15,190
Old man kneels, gasping for breath.

19
00:02:17,810 --> 00:02:19,510
Old man gasps, chest heaving.
